job-description-commissar = Guide the Soviet populace in their ideological journey, by whatever means necessary.
job-description-skb-exec = Manage the SKB Science Team, unlocking technologies, acquiring & researching artifacts, and performing experiments.
job-description-ssf-squad-leader = Lead a squad of Special Forces operatives to acquire various technologies for the USSP.
